                                                "sense_id": "230775aa-d862-363f-87fd-e35c2f3442c2",
                                                "text": "You know and I know that Dr. Tinsley likes a bit of kudosing every now and then. I think it would be well if we seriously considered some kind of honorable mention for him at the Conference."
